Waist yaw: +/-30.0 deg, speed=0.1 rad/s; centre stick decelerates to hold.
Left X toggles right stick up/down: LIFT (default) <-> PITCH. Centre right stick after switching.
Waist pitch: [0.0, 30.0] deg, speed=0.08 rad/s; stick forward leans forward.
Column lift ENABLED: right stick up/down; feedback bounds [0.0, 0.42] m of rt/hispeed_state.y.
